  abilityId: 2861008
  abilityName: Id Unleashed
  abilityDesc: 22 combo Dark attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    boosts Dark elemental damage for 3 turns, adds probable 1 turn Atk, Def reduction
    infliction to attack for 3 turns, boosts damage against status afflicted foes
    for 3 turns, damage taken restores HP for 3 turns & damage taken fills BB gauge
    for 3 turns
